                                        "glosses": [
                                            "in der Art einer Melodie, angenehm klingend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42aa5001-7bb2-4786-a53e-f292b0d57ed2",
                                                "sense_id": "5dda9f80-9d74-35cd-9d8b-19a6b8bb3695",
                                                "text": "Der Gesang der Amsel klingt sehr melodisch."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4d8452ed-d52d-4b29-be86-ce554481fe6a",
                        "source_entry_id": "77932d63-995a-3973-888b-68e449aeeba8",
                        "source_sense_id": "9ed28923-0020-3d70-8c11-da80257e7288",
                        "source_sense_description": "aangenaam klinkend",
                        "target_lang_word": "melodious",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "melodious",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "894e63f1-47fd-3710-bcb4-8da9df6876dc",
                                        "entry_id": "a9f89374-47f4-3dda-b4df-47d4199ec4c0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having a pleasant melody or sound; tuneful."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c429f202-9264-42d0-bdb4-0597a3db0cc6",
                                                "sense_id": "894e63f1-47fd-3710-bcb4-8da9df6876dc",
                                                "text": "Tremulous on the bladed graſs ſhone bright the pearly drops, like an aſſembly of ſparkling ſtars dancing on the plains of the zodiac; vocal was every bending ſpray, every reed was inſpired, each warbling throat ſeemed to emulate the melodious voice of the bird of a thouſand ſongs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5bd146f0-df28-4ae7-8ac4-3af926ee7c64",
                                                "sense_id": "894e63f1-47fd-3710-bcb4-8da9df6876dc",
                                                "text": "A lovely crisp exhaust: a feeling of almost unlimited power combined with complete freedom of running: and, to crown it all, a most melodious and wholly American chime whistle—these were my immediate impressions as we stormed rapidly out of Göttingen, intent on winning back some of the lost time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "184f5fbe-161c-4dcb-b101-71a9b7219de7",
                                                "sense_id": "894e63f1-47fd-3710-bcb4-8da9df6876dc",
                                                "text": "Patinkin’s melodious voice is a natural fit for animation, and he breathes just the right type of upper-crust life into Hugh in 22 short minutes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "839161f8-ff37-4aa2-887f-9d653873e603",
                        "source_entry_id": "77932d63-995a-3973-888b-68e449aeeba8",
                        "source_sense_id": "9ed28923-0020-3d70-8c11-da80257e7288",
                        "source_sense_description": "aangenaam klinkend",
                        "target_lang_word": "mélodieux",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mélodieux",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "27d2c4f1-dd40-32c6-a5b4-b482181849be",
                                        "entry_id": "5eda2cb4-c119-35d0-af4c-dca042ff720f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est agréable à l’oreille."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Mélioratif"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b41d5f3-159d-4181-9a91-ba592ed27119",
                                                "sense_id": "27d2c4f1-dd40-32c6-a5b4-b482181849be",
                                                "text": "Toujours il croyait entendre résonner à son oreille les notes suaves et mélodieuses de la voix de la jeune fille, quelque effort qu’il fit pour oublier ; […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ef37735-1b54-4de9-bf5d-18515aae8880",
                                                "sense_id": "27d2c4f1-dd40-32c6-a5b4-b482181849be",
                                                "text": "Les spectateurs les accompagnaient en battant rythmiquement des mains et en chantant des airs tahitiens plus mélodieux que la dure langue mangarevienne."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
